 "pos": "<p class=\"cap2\"><b>Lines 1 and 2: the C position.</b> Thumb on middle C, 1 2 3 4 5 up to G.</p><p class=\"cap2\"><b>Line 3: the hand opens.</b> Thumb stays on C; 2 3 4 5 move up one key, so G A G F E C is 4 5 4 3 2 1.</p><p class=\"cap2\"><b>Din, dan, don:</b> the low G is the left hand’s thumb.</p>",
